sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant A as Lambda api
    participant S as Lambda appointments
    participant P as PostgreSQL
    C->>A: POST /api/v1/appointments
    A->>A: Validate the body with Zod
    A->>S: Invoke { type: "appointments.create", payload }
    S->>P: SELECT overlapping appointments
    P-->>S: 0 rows
    S->>P: INSERT INTO appointments
    alt SQLSTATE 23P01 (exclusion violation)
        P-->>S: slot taken
        S-->>A: { ok: false, error: SLOT_NOT_AVAILABLE }
        A-->>C: 409 problem+json
    else inserted
        P-->>S: row
        S-->>A: { ok: true, data: Appointment }
        A-->>C: 201 Created
    end
